Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

kaitai_struct_formats (git submodule)
  The kaitai_struct_formats/ directory is a git submodule that points at
  https://github.com/iyourshaw/kaitai_struct_formats, a fork of
  https://github.com/kaitai-io/kaitai_struct_formats. It isn't part of this
  product, and the Apache License above doesn't apply to it. Each .ksy file in
  it is licensed separately, as given by its meta/license tag and comments.

  The specs these tests compile, and their licenses:
    network/pcapng/*.ksy (pcapng, its 9 block files, pcapng_options and
    pcapng_link_frame), network/linux_sll.ksy, network/ieee802_11.ksy,
    network/radiotap.ksy
        Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Neaera Consulting LLC
    network/pcap.ksy, network/ethernet_frame.ksy, network/packet_ppi.ksy,
    network/ipv4_packet.ksy, network/ipv6_packet.ksy, network/tcp_segment.ksy,
    network/udp_datagram.ksy, network/icmp_packet.ksy, network/protocol_body.ksy
        CC0-1.0

  The decoders generated from these specs (tests/*/generated/, build/) are
  derived from them and keep each spec's license. They aren't committed.

  The Graphviz diagrams in tests/graphviz/dot/ and tests/graphviz/svg/ are
  generated from the same specs (ksc -t graphviz, then Graphviz's dot) and are
  committed. Each keeps the license of the spec it is drawn from: Apache-2.0
  for the pcapng* files, linux_sll, ieee802_11 and radiotap, and
  CC0-1.0 for the others.

